<title>POLAND: BOS APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 5.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>BOS APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 5.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  5.76 vs    8.67</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   10.23 vs    9.62</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 15.61 vs   15.98</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	20.54 vs   24.18</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL				     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 27.23 vs   17.60</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   40.77 vs   26.45</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 60.44 vs   40.69</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	78.47 vs   80.06</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Ochrony Srodowiska</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
